# Source package for GTA IV - not served by the site. Its original 7.8 GB ISO
# and 66 MB wasm exceed Cloudflare's per-asset size limit; the playable copy
# lives in games/gta4/ with both files split into .partNNN chunks.
gta4-web-v0.1.8/

# Raw per-file source dumps used to build the vc-sky-en/ru v6 data packages.
# The site serves the prebuilt, split packages from games/gta/vc/vcbr/ instead
# (game.js loads /vcbr/vc-sky-*-v6.data and the service worker rejoins parts),
# so these are never requested at runtime (~31k files, ~1.5 GB of deploy).
games/gta/vc/vcsky/fetched/
games/gta/vc/vcsky/fetched-ru/